{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17595","headline":"故萧尚书瘿柏斋前玉蘂树与王起居吏部孟员外同赏 · 羊士谔","name":"故萧尚书瘿柏斋前玉蘂树与王起居吏部孟员外同赏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柏寝闭何时，瑶华自满枝。\n天清凝积素，风暖动芬丝。\n留步苍苔暗，停觞白日迟。\n因吟茂陵草，幽赏待妍词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}